function prompt(){return `Selected design layer: ${S.view}. Overhead light strands: ${JSON.stringify(S.strings)}. Underground diagrams are approximate design records; do not infer real pipe depths.\nZIP ${S.zip||'not supplied'}; quote market ${S.location?.city||'unverified'}. Paths: ${JSON.stringify(S.paths)}. Utility planning notes: ${JSON.stringify(S.routes)}. Preserve the walkway surfaces and constructed footprints.\nCreate a photorealistic garden visualization using the attached Terra top-down layout as a strict geometry reference.\nProject: ${S.name}.\nBoundary: ${S.shape}; site dimensions ${S.width} × ${S.depth} ft. Approximate area ${Math.round(estimate().area)} sq ft. Boundary normalized points (X right, Y down): ${JSON.stringify(S.points)}. ${S.shape==='curve'?'Rounded corners, rounding factor '+S.curve+'.':''}\nGround: ${MATERIALS[S.material].name}. Soil beds: ${JSON.stringify(S.zones.map(z=>({name:z.name,points:z.points})))}.\nObjects and locations (coordinates measured from upper-left in feet):\n${S.items.map(i=>`${CATALOG[i.kind].name}: X ${(i.x*S.width).toFixed(1)}, Y ${(i.y*S.depth).toFixed(1)}, footprint ${i.w} × ${i.h} ft, rotation ${i.angle}°`).join('\n')}\nSeason: ${S.season}. Time: ${S.night?'night':'warm daylight'}. Garden lights: ${S.lights?'on':'off'}.\nAtmosphere: tactile terracotta, olive and forest greens, warm Southern European courtyard. Real materials, believable scale, natural shadows. Preserve the exact number, placements and types of objects from the reference. Do not add pools, structures, paving areas or other items not in the plan. Keep site geometry; choose a useful eye-level perspective. Uploaded photo, if supplied separately, is a visual reference only and is not a measured survey. This is a conceptual image, not a construction drawing. Plants and seasonal appearance are visual approximations, not a suitability claim.`}
